Package: datapond
Title: Offline-First Data Lifecycle Management
Version: 1.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Paul", "Gordijn", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "paul.gordijn@kznwildlife.com")
Author: Paul Gordijn [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Paul Gordijn <paul.gordijn@kznwildlife.com>
Description: Provides a local Shiny application for managing the dataset
    lifecycle, documenting metadata, maintaining a pond-local SQLite catalogue,
    organising lifecycle folders, inventorying data files, and extracting
    spatial metadata. The application is designed for offline and
    low-connectivity environments.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Quarto and XeLaTeX (for PDF document generation),
    Python (>= 3.9, for document inventories and dataset releases)
